GCF: Flower Therapy

"That's a nice plant," said a woman at the florist's shop, pointing 
to the flower I was buying.

"Yeah, my wife and I had an argument," I admitted. "I was going to 
buy her a dozen roses, but I don't think she's that mad at me."


----------- Today's saying or thought -------------------------

Buy a dog a toy and the dog will play with it forever.
Buy a cat a toy and the cat will play with the wrapper for 10 minutes.

